1
00:00:11,200 --> 00:00:18,260
♪If I am gone from this world,
will the dark night collapse?♪

2
00:00:18,880 --> 00:00:25,820
♪If I never return
to guard by your side♪

3
00:00:26,270 --> 00:00:30,800
♪If I seal away our encounter
and erase all trace♪

4
00:00:31,010 --> 00:00:33,900
♪Like endless snow
falling into the deep sea♪

5
00:00:34,050 --> 00:00:40,350
♪This life is but a fleeting illusion,
yet it gave me courage♪

6
00:00:40,510 --> 00:00:41,740
♪Love is a miracle♪

7
00:00:41,740 --> 00:00:42,920
=Spring Over Phoenix Pond=

8
00:00:42,920 --> 00:00:45,300
(Adapted from Qin An'an's
"Spring Over Phoenix Pond")

9
00:00:45,340 --> 00:00:48,260
=Episode 7=

10
00:00:59,110 --> 00:01:00,070
Your Highness.

11
00:01:15,840 --> 00:01:16,640
Your Highness,

12
00:01:16,950 --> 00:01:18,400
thank you for saving my life.

13
00:01:19,280 --> 00:01:20,870
I heard you were ill for a long time,

14
00:01:21,590 --> 00:01:23,230
but now you seem fully recovered.

15
00:01:24,200 --> 00:01:25,400
Congratulations, Your Highness.

16
00:01:29,870 --> 00:01:30,760
How did you manage to

17
00:01:30,760 --> 00:01:32,480
get yourself into such a mess?

18
00:01:33,090 --> 00:01:34,590
Has Qi Yuan returned to the residence?

19
00:01:36,150 --> 00:01:37,400
Your Highness, you know Qi...

20
00:01:37,400 --> 00:01:38,350
I ask,

21
00:01:39,200 --> 00:01:40,120
and you answer.

22
00:01:41,870 --> 00:01:42,480
Yes.

23
00:01:43,280 --> 00:01:44,400
Qi Yuan has returned.

24
00:01:49,400 --> 00:01:50,000
Your Highness,

25
00:01:51,000 --> 00:01:52,310
I know Qi Yuan inside and out.

26
00:01:52,800 --> 00:01:54,370
No matter how you want to deal with her,

27
00:01:54,790 --> 00:01:55,760
I can help you.

28
00:01:59,680 --> 00:02:00,350
Zhuque,

29
00:02:01,920 --> 00:02:04,510
take her back and train her well.

30
00:02:05,120 --> 00:02:06,120
Besides,

31
00:02:07,640 --> 00:02:09,630
it's time to activate
our other hidden pawn

32
00:02:10,000 --> 00:02:11,630
in the Qi Residence.

33
00:02:18,590 --> 00:02:20,280
(I treated you with sincerity,)

34
00:02:20,630 --> 00:02:23,240
(yet you caused my death
on the eve of my enthronement.)

35
00:02:25,470 --> 00:02:26,470
This time,

36
00:02:27,680 --> 00:02:30,360
don't even think
about escaping my grasp.

37
00:02:35,030 --> 00:02:37,470
Why does my shoulder hurt so suddenly?

38
00:02:41,080 --> 00:02:42,280
Could Prince Qi...

39
00:02:43,240 --> 00:02:43,800
Is he...

40
00:02:45,100 --> 00:02:46,500
(Marquis Yongping Residence)

41
00:02:46,520 --> 00:02:47,080
Your Highness,

42
00:02:47,220 --> 00:02:48,580
news came from the Eastern Palace.

43
00:02:49,120 --> 00:02:50,430
Someone indeed added an extra herb

44
00:02:50,840 --> 00:02:52,560
to the Crown Prince's decoction.

45
00:02:53,000 --> 00:02:54,160
I asked the imperial physician.

46
00:02:54,260 --> 00:02:56,840
Long-term consumption of this herb
will erode the heart channels

47
00:02:57,150 --> 00:02:58,390
and lead to death from weakness.

48
00:02:59,840 --> 00:03:01,030
Who could be so vicious?

49
00:03:03,590 --> 00:03:05,680
Have someone secretly replace that herb.

50
00:03:05,870 --> 00:03:06,800
Don't alert the enemy.

51
00:03:07,280 --> 00:03:08,840
We must find out who is behind this.

52
00:03:09,080 --> 00:03:09,520
Understood.

53
00:03:13,400 --> 00:03:14,150
Qi Yuan...

54
00:03:15,840 --> 00:03:16,800
How did you know

55
00:03:16,800 --> 00:03:18,150
about my father's medicine?

56
00:03:19,310 --> 00:03:22,400
Just how many secrets are you hiding?

57
00:03:26,000 --> 00:03:28,100
(Han Yue'e, Qi Yuan's cousin)
(Your Highness,)

58
00:03:28,120 --> 00:03:30,080
(I will not disappoint you.)

59
00:03:31,500 --> 00:03:32,980
(Your Highness Prince Qi)

60
00:03:36,400 --> 00:03:37,360
Father, Mother,

61
00:03:37,360 --> 00:03:38,670
why didn't you tell me
you were returning?

62
00:03:38,680 --> 00:03:39,800
I could have gone to welcome you.

63
00:03:40,800 --> 00:03:43,630
Who is behind the scenes
manipulating Qi Zhao

64
00:03:43,870 --> 00:03:46,800
(Old Marquis, Qi Yuan's grandfather)
into doing those absurd things?

65
00:03:48,520 --> 00:03:51,280
Greetings, Grandfather and Grandmother.

66
00:03:57,430 --> 00:03:58,080
Grandfather.

67
00:03:59,030 --> 00:03:59,710
Grandmother.

68
00:03:59,900 --> 00:04:01,540
(Old Marquise, Qi Yuan's grandmother)

69
00:04:01,870 --> 00:04:02,710
You may leave.

70
00:04:05,470 --> 00:04:06,400
Yuan,

71
00:04:06,680 --> 00:04:07,310
come.

72
00:04:08,030 --> 00:04:09,400
Come here.

73
00:04:14,870 --> 00:04:15,840
Tell me,

74
00:04:16,160 --> 00:04:18,750
were your adoptive parents good to you?

75
00:04:20,040 --> 00:04:20,720
No.

76
00:04:21,700 --> 00:04:22,830
I suffered hunger and cold,

77
00:04:23,260 --> 00:04:24,270
beatings and verbal abuse.

78
00:04:25,270 --> 00:04:26,240
When I was gravely ill,

79
00:04:26,680 --> 00:04:29,120
I was even branded
with the scalding bottom of a bowl.

80
00:04:29,240 --> 00:04:30,160
Yuan,

81
00:04:31,040 --> 00:04:32,510
you have suffered so much.

82
00:04:33,920 --> 00:04:35,800
So you harmed

83
00:04:35,800 --> 00:04:37,600
three lives at the estate?

84
00:04:41,160 --> 00:04:41,800
Yes.

85
00:04:43,190 --> 00:04:44,550
Killing outsiders would be justified

86
00:04:44,560 --> 00:04:46,160
since they insulted you.

87
00:04:46,160 --> 00:04:48,000
Qi Zhao is your
biological brother, though.

88
00:04:48,000 --> 00:04:49,600
How could you bring yourself to do it?

89
00:04:49,870 --> 00:04:51,600
You even made it a massive scandal,

90
00:04:51,750 --> 00:04:54,000
ruining the reputation of the Qis.

91
00:04:54,390 --> 00:04:55,600
Since you have found out

92
00:04:55,600 --> 00:04:56,680
the truth of this matter,

93
00:04:57,000 --> 00:04:58,070
you must also know

94
00:04:58,390 --> 00:05:00,120
what they did to me.

95
00:05:01,160 --> 00:05:01,920
How dare you!

96
00:05:02,240 --> 00:05:04,630
Do you think
because you are of Qi blood,

97
00:05:05,000 --> 00:05:06,480
I won't punish you?

98
00:05:06,680 --> 00:05:07,800
If you insist,

99
00:05:08,070 --> 00:05:09,390
I am willing to take the punishment.

100
00:05:09,560 --> 00:05:11,160
However, I beg for a chance

101
00:05:11,160 --> 00:05:12,360
to make up for my mistakes.

102
00:05:12,720 --> 00:05:15,190
Nonsense.
The Qi family's reputation is ruined.

103
00:05:15,190 --> 00:05:16,360
How can you restore it?

104
00:05:16,480 --> 00:05:18,240
Reputation is merely icing on the cake.

105
00:05:18,870 --> 00:05:22,240
Imperial favor
is the true foundation of the Qi family.

106
00:05:22,550 --> 00:05:24,160
The Eldest Princess
living in seclusion in the mountains

107
00:05:24,160 --> 00:05:25,830
is His Majesty's deep regret.

108
00:05:26,070 --> 00:05:28,830
If our family resolves
this regret for His Majesty,

109
00:05:29,160 --> 00:05:30,310
who would dare bring up

110
00:05:30,600 --> 00:05:31,630
today's scandal again?

111
00:05:36,190 --> 00:05:38,830
Can you really
invite the Eldest Princess

112
00:05:38,830 --> 00:05:40,360
to attend this welcome ceremony?

113
00:05:40,510 --> 00:05:41,360
If I fail,

114
00:05:41,820 --> 00:05:43,240
I will willingly accept punishment.

115
00:05:44,480 --> 00:05:45,070
Very well.

116
00:05:45,870 --> 00:05:46,870
If you break your word,

117
00:05:46,880 --> 00:05:48,780
I will hand you over
to the Court of Judicial Review

118
00:05:48,920 --> 00:05:50,510
to settle the capital charges

119
00:05:50,920 --> 00:05:51,870
hanging over your head.

120
00:05:53,160 --> 00:05:54,750
(It seems for this welcome ceremony,)

121
00:05:55,330 --> 00:05:57,360
(I must secure
the Eldest Princess no matter what.)

122
00:06:10,600 --> 00:06:11,920
Young Lady Qi,

123
00:06:12,510 --> 00:06:13,560
what brings you here?

124
00:06:14,090 --> 00:06:16,270
When Your Highness goes
to invite the Eldest Princess today,

125
00:06:16,510 --> 00:06:17,470
if you run into obstacles,

126
00:06:17,480 --> 00:06:19,000
just hand her this food box.

127
00:06:26,720 --> 00:06:28,120
Before I help you,

128
00:06:28,750 --> 00:06:30,190
shouldn't you tell me

129
00:06:30,800 --> 00:06:33,270
how you knew my father was poisoned?

130
00:06:35,680 --> 00:06:36,920
It's a long story

131
00:06:36,920 --> 00:06:37,950
and involves many people.

132
00:06:38,160 --> 00:06:39,680
When the welcome ceremony ends,

133
00:06:39,920 --> 00:06:41,310
I will tell you everything.

134
00:06:45,390 --> 00:06:46,160
Is that true?

135
00:06:49,360 --> 00:06:50,160
It is.

136
00:06:54,190 --> 00:06:54,750
Alright.

137
00:06:55,390 --> 00:06:56,510
I'll trust you this once.

138
00:07:01,190 --> 00:07:01,750
By the way,

139
00:07:03,190 --> 00:07:04,560
do not sneak a bite.

140
00:07:16,070 --> 00:07:17,160
Yam starch baos?

141
00:07:36,940 --> 00:07:39,300
(Prince Qi Residence)

142
00:07:40,070 --> 00:07:42,310
(Qi Yuan's welcome ceremony
will be held as scheduled.)

143
00:07:42,800 --> 00:07:44,310
(Prince Jing has agreed)

144
00:07:44,310 --> 00:07:46,240
(to help her invite
the Eldest Princess.)

145
00:07:47,000 --> 00:07:48,120
Qi Yuan,

146
00:07:50,270 --> 00:07:52,000
so what if Xiao Yunting helps you?

147
00:07:52,380 --> 00:07:54,190
Whether the Eldest Princess
shows up or not,

148
00:07:54,830 --> 00:07:58,000
you won't be able to pull off
this welcome ceremony.

149
00:08:01,040 --> 00:08:01,680
Zhuque,

150
00:08:02,680 --> 00:08:04,920
deliver this invitation to Father.

151
00:08:05,510 --> 00:08:06,000
Yes.

152
00:08:09,630 --> 00:08:10,800
Qi Yuan,

153
00:08:11,360 --> 00:08:13,000
I will make you wander in exile

154
00:08:13,000 --> 00:08:14,240
just like in our past life,

155
00:08:14,560 --> 00:08:16,600
entirely at my mercy.

156
00:08:19,630 --> 00:08:21,510
Who cares if you refuse?

157
00:08:21,680 --> 00:08:23,560
I will force your hand anyway.

158
00:08:33,080 --> 00:08:35,240
After such a huge scandal
in the Qi family,

159
00:08:35,390 --> 00:08:37,790
how dare they throw
a grand welcome ceremony?

160
00:08:38,200 --> 00:08:40,240
Didn't they say the Eldest Princess
is coming today?

161
00:08:40,440 --> 00:08:41,630
I really can't believe it.

162
00:08:41,660 --> 00:08:43,270
How many years has it been
since she came down the mountain?

163
00:08:44,120 --> 00:08:46,200
Even the Emperor couldn't persuade her.

164
00:08:46,250 --> 00:08:47,960
What makes
a wild country girl think she can?

165
00:08:49,320 --> 00:08:52,000
The Qis are about to make
a huge fool of themselves again.

166
00:08:52,720 --> 00:08:54,480
You actually
put your trust in that girl?

167
00:08:54,510 --> 00:08:55,630
She causes trouble every day,

168
00:08:55,640 --> 00:08:57,600
making our whole family
a laughingstock in public.

169
00:08:57,600 --> 00:08:58,510
Watch your mouth.

170
00:09:01,720 --> 00:09:02,320
Marquis,

171
00:09:02,480 --> 00:09:03,360
the auspicious hour has arrived.

172
00:09:03,360 --> 00:09:04,200
Do you think...

173
00:09:05,000 --> 00:09:06,870
Until our honored guest arrives,
it is not an auspicious hour.

174
00:09:06,960 --> 00:09:07,480
Understood.

175
00:09:08,590 --> 00:09:10,030
The auspicious hour is about to pass.

176
00:09:10,040 --> 00:09:11,550
Why hasn't the Eldest Princess
arrived yet?

177
00:09:11,790 --> 00:09:12,550
That's right,

178
00:09:12,550 --> 00:09:13,630
what's taking her so long?

179
00:09:14,200 --> 00:09:14,870
Everyone,

180
00:09:15,150 --> 00:09:17,720
it's a long way from Baiyun Temple.

181
00:09:18,080 --> 00:09:20,320
Perhaps Her Highness was delayed

182
00:09:20,320 --> 00:09:21,240
on the road.

183
00:09:21,910 --> 00:09:23,670
Please stay calm.

184
00:09:23,670 --> 00:09:25,120
Be patient.

185
00:09:32,870 --> 00:09:34,480
If the Eldest Princess doesn't show up,

186
00:09:35,720 --> 00:09:37,510
it's going to be
so embarrassing for you.

187
00:09:54,820 --> 00:09:59,460
♪How I wish to hold
onto this fleeting warmth♪

188
00:09:59,840 --> 00:10:03,620
♪How I wish to live
this life only for you♪

189
00:10:04,130 --> 00:10:09,590
♪When memories sink
and the heart settles♪

190
00:10:09,810 --> 00:10:13,970
♪Forgetting life, death,
parting, and reunion♪

191
00:10:14,760 --> 00:10:19,040
♪How I wish to stay
only in the moment with you♪

192
00:10:19,840 --> 00:10:26,740
♪Anchoring myself by your side♪
